{"4232670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dig To Escape", "steam_appid": 4232670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><i><strong>Dig to Escape</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab your shovel and plan your escape.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig to Escape is a <strong>stylized VR prison-break adventure</strong> where you dig tunnels, collect resources, deal with rival inmates, and attempt daring escapes from a high-security prison. Every run pushes you to adapt your strategy and make smart choices under pressure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig Your Way Out </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physically dig underground using <strong>VR shovel mechanics</strong> to break through prison structures and uncover new paths. Dig carefully—your actions can attract unwanted attention.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232670/extras/b8216675b943ebf3428c3e104e1dc580.poster.avif?t=1772759549\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232670/extras/b8216675b943ebf3428c3e104e1dc580.webm?t=1772759549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232670/extras/b8216675b943ebf3428c3e104e1dc580.mp4?t=1772759549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Threats </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sneaky mole may steal your mined resources. Stay alert and react quickly to protect your escape plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232670/extras/cb3dbb8ade96076c61a3b8e307330738.poster.avif?t=1772759549\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232670/extras/cb3dbb8ade96076c61a3b8e307330738.webm?t=1772759549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232670/extras/cb3dbb8ade96076c61a3b8e307330738.mp4?t=1772759549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inmate Interactions </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, intimidate, or outsmart other prisoners and complete optional quests that can help—or complicate—your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232670/extras/7aa6782e59de72ab3e0ac0a4af1bd1a1.poster.avif?t=1772759549\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232670/extras/7aa6782e59de72ab3e0ac0a4af1bd1a1.webm?t=1772759549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232670/extras/7aa6782e59de72ab3e0ac0a4af1bd1a1.mp4?t=1772759549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Designed for VR</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR-first physical interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comfortable locomotion options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized visuals and light-hearted tone</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig to Escape</strong> delivers replayable VR gameplay where every decision brings you closer to freedom—or back to your cell.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><i><strong>Dig to Escape</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab your shovel and plan your escape.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig to Escape is a <strong>stylized VR prison-break adventure</strong> where you dig tunnels, collect resources, deal with rival inmates, and attempt daring escapes from a high-security prison. Every run pushes you to adapt your strategy and make smart choices under pressure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig Your Way Out </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physically dig underground using <strong>VR shovel mechanics</strong> to break through prison structures and uncover new paths. Dig carefully—your actions can attract unwanted attention.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232670/extras/b8216675b943ebf3428c3e104e1dc580.poster.avif?t=1772759549\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232670/extras/b8216675b943ebf3428c3e104e1dc580.webm?t=1772759549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232670/extras/b8216675b943ebf3428c3e104e1dc580.mp4?t=1772759549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Threats </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sneaky mole may steal your mined resources. Stay alert and react quickly to protect your escape plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232670/extras/cb3dbb8ade96076c61a3b8e307330738.poster.avif?t=1772759549\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232670/extras/cb3dbb8ade96076c61a3b8e307330738.webm?t=1772759549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232670/extras/cb3dbb8ade96076c61a3b8e307330738.mp4?t=1772759549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inmate Interactions </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, intimidate, or outsmart other prisoners and complete optional quests that can help—or complicate—your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232670/extras/7aa6782e59de72ab3e0ac0a4af1bd1a1.poster.avif?t=1772759549\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232670/extras/7aa6782e59de72ab3e0ac0a4af1bd1a1.webm?t=1772759549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232670/extras/7aa6782e59de72ab3e0ac0a4af1bd1a1.mp4?t=1772759549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Designed for VR</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR-first physical interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comfortable locomotion options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized visuals and light-hearted tone</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig to Escape</strong> delivers replayable VR gameplay where every decision brings you closer to freedom—or back to your cell.</p>", "short_description": "Dig to Escape is a VR prison-break adventure where you dig tunnels, complete risky inmate quests, fight rivals, avoid guards, and upgrade your tools to plan the perfect escape. Every run challenges you to adapt, improvise, and outsmart the prison from the inside.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232670/669a73a9bef8984af2bf01b89a8ad8963bd6f5b2/header.jpg?t=1772759549", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i